 Enterprise Compliance Audit Verification

To verify that your cloud network walls are operating with a true "fail-closed" security setup, administrators should run this quick testing protocol:
#
1. Disconnect your personal computer from the corporate network or corporate VPN.

2. Attempt to ping or curl the api link from a generic public network connection:
#
bash
curl -I https://onrender.com

#
Target Success Result: The terminal should return an access denial code or fail to resolve completely. If the command returns a successful response code while you are on a public network, it means the isolation parameters have not fully committed to the cluster database yet.